  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-maroon pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Object</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/TO_%28439%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20251031154142\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"TO (439)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/TO_%28439%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20251031154142\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/TO_%28439%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20251031154142 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/TO_%28439%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20251031154142 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"TO (439)\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"TO_%28439%29.png\" data-image-name=\"TO (439).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Mike Morningstar/Darkstar (Ben 10 series) using the <b>Dominus Librium</b> to absorb the Tennyson cousins' powers.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtain absorption powers via objects.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>Object that <b>grants its user absorption powers</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Powers_Via_Object\" title=\"Trait:Powers Via Object\">Powers Via Object</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user has access to an object that grants them absorption powers. Whether they are accessories, tools or weapons, the objects are capable of enabling powerful abilities associated with their particular absorbing power or even enhancing preexisting capabilities.\n</p><p>There are various ways absorption objects can impart their powers to their users. They can be supernaturally imbued with an absorption-based force which the wielder can access. They can be possessed by some type of entity associated with absorption. The user can bond with the entity or wield it as a living tool. Powerful as they can be the user must be careful not to be overwhelmed by the force/energy wielded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Absorption\" title=\"Category:Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Bestowal\" title=\"Power Bestowal\">Power Bestowal</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Weaponry\" title=\"Absorption Weaponry\">Absorption Weaponry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Blade_Construction\" title=\"Absorption Blade Construction\">Absorption Blade Construction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Sword_Proficiency\" title=\"Absorption Sword Proficiency\">Absorption Sword Proficiency</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Bow_Construction\" title=\"Absorption Bow Construction\">Absorption Bow Construction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Polearm_Construction\" title=\"Absorption Polearm Construction\">Absorption Polearm Construction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Ranged_Weaponry\" title=\"Absorption Ranged Weaponry\">Absorption Ranged Weaponry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Whip_Generation\" title=\"Absorption Whip Generation\">Absorption Whip Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Powers_Via_Object\" title=\"Trait:Powers Via Object\">Powers Via Object</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Inexperienced users may have difficulty controlling the power granted to them.</li>\n<li>May be limited to certain types of absorption.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Object_Immunity\" title=\"Object Immunity\">Object Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Object_Negation\" title=\"Object Negation\">Object Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Various Shinobi (<i>Black Sun</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Sango_Yasuke\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Sango Yasuke\">Sango Yasuke</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Sango_Sekiryu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Sango Sekiryu\">Sango Sekiryu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Ghost_Hand\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Ghost Hand\">Daku/Ghost Hand</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/J%C5%ABshir%C5%8D_Ukitake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Jūshirō Ukitake\">Jūshirō Ukitake</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Nozomi_Kuj%C5%8D\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Nozomi Kujō\">Nozomi Kujō</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Tatsu_Yamashiro_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Tatsu Yamashiro (New Earth)\">Tatsu Yamashiro/Katana</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Naturon_Shenron\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Naturon Shenron\">Naturon Shenron</a> (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://infinite-level-up-in-murim.fandom.com/wiki/Miyamoto_Mamoru\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:infinite-level-up-in-murim:Miyamoto Mamoru\">Miyamoto Mamoru</a> (<i>Infinite Leveling: Murim</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://infinite-level-up-in-murim.fandom.com/wiki/Dan_Yuseong\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:infinite-level-up-in-murim:Dan Yuseong\">Dan Yuseong</a> (<i>Infinite Leveling: Murim</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Kisame_Hoshigaki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Kisame Hoshigaki\">Kisame Hoshigaki</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Killer_B\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Killer B\">Killer B/B</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Teacher (<i>Reincarnated as a Sword</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Devourers\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Devourers\">Devourers</a> (<i>Black Sun</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Dominus_Librium\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Dominus Librium\">Dominus Librium</a> (<i>Ben 10 series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Soultaker_Sword\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Soultaker Sword\">Soultaker Sword</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Dragon-scaled Tessaiga (<i>InuYasha</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacyofkain.fandom.com/wiki/Soul_Reaver\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:legacyofkain:Soul Reaver\">Soul Reaver</a> (<i>Legacy of Kain</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Samehada\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Samehada\">Samehada</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Jutsu_Absorbing_Arm\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Jutsu Absorbing Arm\">Jutsu Absorbing Arm</a> (<i>Boruto: Naruto Next Generations</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ninjagaiden.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Dragon_Blade\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ninjagaiden:Dark Dragon Blade\">Dark Dragon Blade</a> (<i>Ninja Gaiden</i>)</li>\n<li>Savage Sword (<i>Power Rangers</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://soulcalibur.fandom.com/wiki/Soul_Edge\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:soulcalibur:Soul Edge\">Soul Edge</a> (<i>Soul series</i>)</li>\n<li>Gengetsu (<i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 2: Battle Nexus</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://xiaolinpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Sun_Chi_Lantern\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:xiaolinpedia:Sun Chi Lantern\">Sun Chi Lantern</a> (<i>Xiaolin Showdown</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Object%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3c30570687198574e654ba04bbfcb990\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Naturon_absorbs_Pan-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:195px; top:24.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Naturon_absorbs_Pan.jpg\" title=\"Naturon absorbs Pan.jpg (45 KB)\" style=\"height:146px; width:195px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/be/Naturon_absorbs_Pan.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/195?cb=20251031154043\" title=\"Naturon absorbs Pan.jpg (45 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Naturon Shenron (Dragon Ball GT) absorbing Pan through his Dragon Ball.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Naturon absorbs Pan.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Naturon_absorbs_Pan.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Naturon Shenron (Dragon Ball GT) absorbing Pan through his Dragon Ball.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Naturon absorbs Pan.jpg (45 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Naturon Shenron (Dragon Ball GT) absorbing Pan through his Dragon Ball.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Naturon absorbs Pan.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Naturon_absorbs_Pan.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Naturon Shenron (Dragon Ball GT) absorbing Pan through his Dragon Ball.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/be/Naturon_absorbs_Pan.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/195?cb=20251031154043\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:195px;